---
// Hybrid model structure: the network corrects growth inside the physical ODE.
---
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 270" role="img" aria-label="Hybrid model: a neural network outputs a correction to the growth rate, which feeds Monod and Luedeking-Piret kinetics and the mass balances, integrated by an ODE solver to predict X, S and P over time">
  <defs>
    <marker id="ah-ferm" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-head" />
    </marker>
  </defs>
  <g transform="translate(0,30)">

  <rect x="10" y="40" width="150" height="64" rx="4" class="dg-box" />
  <text x="85" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text">state y(t)</text>
  <text x="85" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">X, S, P  [g/L]</text>

  <rect x="10" y="170" width="150" height="64" rx="4" class="dg-box" />
  <text x="85" y="196" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text">conditions</text>
  <text x="85" y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">T [°C], strain, t</text>

  <rect x="215" y="170" width="160" height="64" rx="4" class="dg-box warm" />
  <text x="295" y="196" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text">neural network</text>
  <text x="295" y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">lag correction g(·)</text>

  <rect x="215" y="30" width="250" height="84" rx="4" class="dg-box hl" />
  <text x="340" y="54" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text">kinetics</text>
  <text x="340" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">μ = μmax(T)·f(S,P)·g</text>
  <text x="340" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Monod · Luedeking–Piret · Arrhenius</text>

  <rect x="510" y="30" width="110" height="84" rx="4" class="dg-box hl" />
  <text x="565" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text">mass</text>
  <text x="565" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text">balances</text>
  <text x="565" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">dy/dt</text>

  <rect x="650" y="30" width="100" height="84" rx="4" class="dg-box" />
  <text x="700" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text">ODE</text>
  <text x="700" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text">solver</text>

  <path d="M160 72 H213" class="dg-arrow" marker-end="url(#ah-ferm)" />
  <path d="M160 202 H213" class="dg-arrow" marker-end="url(#ah-ferm)" />
  <path d="M120 104 V140 H260 V168" class="dg-arrow" marker-end="url(#ah-ferm)" />
  <path d="M295 170 V116" class="dg-dash" marker-end="url(#ah-ferm)" />
  <path d="M465 72 H508" class="dg-arrow" marker-end="url(#ah-ferm)" />
  <path d="M620 72 H648" class="dg-arrow" marker-end="url(#ah-ferm)" />
  <path d="M700 30 V8 H85 V38" class="dg-arrow" marker-end="url(#ah-ferm)" />
  <text x="400" y="2" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">integrate, then feed y(t + Δt) back</text>
  <text x="420" y="160" class="dg-sub">physics fixed: yields, P ≤ 0.511·ΔS</text>
  </g>
</svg>
